@PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5280

### Login (get JWT)
POST {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=customer@example.com&password=Password1!

### Refresh token
POST {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token=PUT_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE

### Create a delivery
POST {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/deliveries
Authorization: Bearer PUT_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "details": {
    "clientReference": "REF-001",
    "numberOfVolumes": 2,
    "totalWeightOfVolumes": 4.5,
    "amount": null,
    "instructions": "Leave at the front desk",
    "preferentialPeriod": "09:00-13:00"
  },
  "sender": {
    "name": "Acme Warehouse",
    "contact": { "name": "John Sender", "phoneNumber": "912345678", "email": "sender@example.com" },
    "address": { "addressLine": "Rua A, 1", "place": "Lisboa", "zipCode": "1000-001", "zipCodePlace": "Lisboa", "countryCode": "PT" }
  },
  "receiver": {
    "name": "Jane Receiver",
    "contact": { "name": "Jane Receiver", "phoneNumber": "913333444", "email": "receiver@example.com" },
    "address": { "addressLine": "Rua B, 2", "place": "Porto", "zipCode": "4000-002", "zipCodePlace": "Porto", "countryCode": "PT" }
  },
  "attributes": { "pod": true, "sameDay": false, "cashOnDelivery": false }
}

### Authenticated user's deliveries (paginated)
GET {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/deliveries?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer PUT_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
Accept: application/json

###
